  "Code & schemas — MIT": "Code na Aschéma — MIT",
  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Atapande ti code, JSON Schemas, na amodèle ti ndïä so masïni alîngbi tî diko, ayeke na yâ ti Licence MIT, gï tongana a tene nde. Mo lîngbi tî mû ala na site ti mo mvenî na yongo pëpe.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Lêgë oko ti Lïngö ti Dröa",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Kangbi na Mbongo",
  "Commercial use": "Sarango ti Mbongo",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Sarango ti mbongo ahunda contact",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "A hunda mbeti so na peko ti bûngbi ti Bletchley ndali ti siriri ti IA, na Yoshua Bengio ayeke lï na li ni, na maboko ti ahon azo-métier 100 so alöndö na akodoro 30 pëpe, na UN, OCDE na EU — mbeti so ayeke indépendant afa hïngängö-ye ti fadësô na ndö ti capability na ngbanga ti IA so kötä ahon — na atene so asistème mbâ ayeke hînga fadësô ngoi so azo ayeke bâa ala, na agbïan sarango ti ala.",
  "Companion media": "Média so Ayeke Mbâ",
